<h3>Freeze and water damage</h3>
<p>Winter Storm Uri in February 2021 brought single-digit lows to the region, and pipes in attics and exterior walls can burst in any hard freeze, causing serious interior damage. See <a href="/services/freeze-damage-claims/">freeze damage claims</a> and <a href="/services/water-damage-claims/">water damage claims</a>.</p>

